%N A399764 The main diagonal of the infinite Tchoukaillon array.
%C A399764 A344009 is the complete Tchoukaillon array listed by antidiagonals.
%C A399764 a(n) is asymptotically c*n^2 + O(n^(4/3)), where c=(Pi+2)^2/(4*Pi) \approx 2.1037 ... conjectured by Nikolai Beluhov in 2022, proved by Shisheng Li in 2026.
